copy other: An already destroyed object cannot be copied.
flat other: An already destroyed object cannot be copied.
throw: Access to an object that was handed over to a thread ('fire handover').
take: Access to an object that was handed over to a thread ('fire handover').
foreach: Access to an array that was handed over to a thread ('fire handover').
cast: Access to an object that was handed over to a thread ('fire handover').
end
